    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Tencent has made a new idea called “Pet TV”. It is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "video channel",
            "zh": "视频频道"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " made for cats and dogs. It "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "runs",
            "ref": "v-run"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " all day and night. It helps pets feel less "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "lonely",
            "ref": "v-lonely"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " when their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "owners",
            "ref": "v-owner"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are not at home."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people already leave the TV on for their pets. But "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "normal",
            "zh": "普通的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " TV is not good for animals. Cats and dogs see the world differently from humans. The pictures can look unclear or strange to them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "To "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fix",
            "ref": "v-fix"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " this, Pet TV uses special videos. The videos move "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "smoothly",
            "ref": "v-smoothly"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and clearly. They are made to match how animals see things. This helps pets enjoy what they are watching."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many pet owners say the results are good. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "notice",
            "zh": "注意"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their pets are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "calmer",
            "ref": "v-calm"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Dogs may stop "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "barking",
            "zh": "犬吠"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or chewing things. Instead, they "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "relax",
            "ref": "v-relax"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or watch the screen quietly. Cats often like to watch moving animals like birds or fish."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Experts say this is also a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "smart",
            "ref": "v-smart"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " idea for the company. It gives pets something to do and makes owners feel better when they are away. Now, some people even call it a “TV for pets at home”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
